Package: chiptsne2
Type: Package
Title: ChIPseq analysis using tSNE
Version: 0.1.57
Authors@R: person("Joseph R", "Boyd", email = "jrboyd@uvm.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID="0000-0002-8969-9676"))
Description: chiptsne2 provides support for tSNE and other dimensional 
    reduction techniques for analyzing ChIP-seq profiles.  In addtion, it 
    provides a friendlier and more robust way to work with seqsetvis.
